encrypted PKCS#1: encrypted private keys are not supported
EC key: not an RSA (rsaEncryption) key
RSA-PSS key: not an RSA (rsaEncryption) key
3 primes, PKCS#8: unsupported key version (multi-prime keys are not supported)
3 primes, PKCS#1: unsupported key version (multi-prime keys are not supported)
version1: unsupported key version (multi-prime keys are not supported)
even-e: public exponent is even, below 3, or not below the modulus
e-one: public exponent is even, below 3, or not below the modulus
e-too-big: public exponent is even, below 3, or not below the modulus
modulus-small: modulus is not between 2048 and 4096 bits
modulus-large: modulus is not between 2048 and 4096 bits
p-even: p or q is even or not half the width of the modulus
p-wide: p or q is even or not half the width of the modulus
q-narrow: p * q is not the modulus
pq-not-n: p * q is not the modulus
dp-wide: dP, dQ or qInv is wider than half the modulus
qi-wide: dP, dQ or qInv is wider than half the modulus
negative-dq: malformed DER
nonminimal-e: malformed DER
missing-qi: malformed DER
extra-field: malformed DER
trailing-byte: malformed DER
long-length: malformed DER
nonminimal-length: malformed DER
dp-corrupt: ok
